ugging Face Hub: `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B` (12 files, last modified 2026-10-07T08:20:03Z, 813 downloads)\n\n#### B. Red Team Agent Tools Added (COMPLETE)\nFive new offensive security tools were implemented in `smartagent/agent/tools.py`, expanding the ToolRegistry from 8 to 13 tools:\n\n1. **`recon`** — Network port scanner with nmap integration + socket fallback, banner grabbing, service enumeration\n2. **`exploit_db`** — Embedded CVE/vulnerability advisory database (20+ CVEs: Log4Shell, EternalBlue, Spring4Shell, BlueKeep, PwnKit, Dirty Pipe, ProxyLogon, regreSSHion, Zerologon, PrintNightmare, etc.)\n3. **`generate_payload`** — Security audit payload generator (SQLi, XSS, reverse shells in 6 languages, command injection, SSTI, SSRF, LFI)\n4. **`web_attack`** — Web attack surface assessment (endpoint discovery for .env/.git/admin/swagger, HTTP security header auditing)\n5. **`post_exploit`** — Post-exploitation & privilege escalation checklists for Linux/Windows/Active Directory with MITRE ATT&CK references\n\n#### C. Supporting Changes (COMPLETE)\n- `smartagent/agent/prompts.py` — Updated `CHAT_GREETING` with red team tool examples\n- `smartagent/cli.py` — Updated `info` command to show \"13 tools including Red Team suite\"\n- `docs/benchmarks.md` — Added v0.3.0 retraining milestone section with 65-step loss curve table and red team tool catalog\n- `tests/test_redteam_tools.py` — Created 11 unit tests covering all 5 new tools (all passing)\n- All existing tests in `tests/test_scanners.py` still passing (6 tests)\n- Git committed (`02414f7`) and pushed to `origin/main`\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n\n#### Architecture\n- **ToolRegistry** (`smartagent/agent/tools.py`): Central registry pattern. `_register_builtins()` registers all 13 `ToolSpec` instances. Each tool is a method on `ToolRegistry` that takes a single string arg and returns a string result.\n- **SmartAgent** (`smartagent/agent/core.py`): ReAct loop agent. Uses `ToolRegistry` for tool execution, `AgentMemory` for conversation state, and lazy-loads `ModelManager` for LLM inference.\n- **CLI** (`smartagent/cli.py`): Typer-based CLI with commands: `scan`, `train`, `info`, `chat`. The `chat` command instantiates `SmartAgent` with the ReAct loop.\n- **Scanners** (`smartagent/scanners/`): `SecretScanner`, `PatternScanner`, `DependencyScanner`, `ConfigScanner` — all used by the `scan` CLI command.\n- **AI Judge** (`smartagent/ai/judge.py`): Optional AI verification pass using the model for false-positive reduction.\n\n#### Key Constants & Data\n- `CWE_DATABASE` (tools.py lines ~19-109): 12 CWE entries with name, description, OWASP mapping, CVSS, and remediation\n- `EXPLOIT_DATABASE` (tools.py lines ~112-290): 20 CVE entries with title, service, affected versions, CVSS, CWE, attack vector, and remediation\n- `ALLOWED_COMMANDS` (tools.py lines ~296-318): Allowlist for the sandboxed `run_command` tool\n- `IGNORE_DIRS` (tools.py lines ~293-295): Directory exclusion set for file traversal\n\n#### Constraints\n- No PyTorch/CUDA locally — model inference only works on Colab or GPU machines\n- `benchmark_suite.py` requires `torch` and `transformers` imports (cannot run locally)\n- The `run_colab_training.py` script references `model` and `tokenizer` variables that must be defined in earlier Colab cells (the script is designed to be exec'd inside a notebook context, not run standalone)\n\n### 5. Files and Code\n\n#### Edited Files\n| File | Changes | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| `smartagent/agent/tools.py` | Added imports (socket, shutil, urllib), EXPLOIT_DATABASE (~180 lines), 5 new tool registrations in `_register_builtins()`, 5 new tool method implementations (~500 lines at end of file) | Red team tool suite |\n| `smartagent/agent/prompts.py` | Updated `CHAT_GREETING` (lines 47-60) | Show red team examples in interactive mode |\n| `smartagent/cli.py` | Changed line 167: \"8 tools\" → \"13 tools including Red Team suite\" | Accurate tool count in `info` command |\n| `docs/benchmarks.m