nder `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`, and add 5 red team agent tools locally to the smartAGENT codebase.\n- **Constraints:** STRICT ZERO MENTION of legacy base model names (\"Qwen\", \"qwen2\", \"Alibaba\") in all code, commits, and docs. Aggressive vulnerability flagging is desired.\n- **Success Criteria:** Both Part 1 (Colab retraining + HF deployment) and Part 2 (red team tools in agent) fully completed, tested, and pushed to GitHub.\n\n### 2. Progress — ALL COMPLETE\n\n**Part 1 — Model Retraining (COMPLETED):**\n- 520 balanced training sequences (170 red team CoT × 2 + 24 security CoT × 5 + 15 identity × 4) were created and tokenized.\n- Dataset files: `data/custom_cot/redteam_cot.jsonl` (170 samples), `data/custom_cot/security_cot.jsonl` (24), `data/custom_cot/identity_alignment.jsonl` (15).\n- Training script: `scripts/run_colab_training.py` — downloads from GitHub raw URLs, tokenizes, runs 65-step QLoRA fine-tuning (lr=8e-5, effective batch=8), merges to 16-bit, uploads via HfApi.\n- Executed on Google Colab (Tesla T4 GPU): 65/65 steps completed in 430.8s, final loss `0.8952`.\n- Loss progression: Step 5→1.2365, Step 25→0.9387, Step 50→0.7604, Step 65→0.8347.\n- 16-bit merge completed via Unsloth `save_pretrained_merged`.\n- **Model LIVE on Hugging Face:** `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B` (last modified 2026-10-07T08:20:03Z, 12 files including 2 safetensor shards).\n\n**Part 2 — Red Team Agent Tools (COMPLETED):**\n- 5 new tools added to `smartagent/agent/tools.py`, expanding from 8 to 13 tools total:\n  1. **`recon`** — Network port scanner with nmap wrapper + socket fallback, banner grabbing, attack surface notes.\n  2. **`exploit_db`** — Embedded 20-CVE database (Log4Shell, EternalBlue, Spring4Shell, BlueKeep, PwnKit, Dirty Pipe, ProxyLogon, regreSSHion, Zerologon, PrintNightmare, etc.) with keyword + CVE search.\n  3. **`generate_payload`** — Generates audit probes for SQLi, XSS, cmdi, reverse shells (Bash/Python/NC/PowerShell/Socat), SSTI, SSRF, LFI.\n  4. **`web